{"title":"interview on common shapes with cody cook-parrott","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/common-shapes-interview","date":1763728365000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a8e51032-ccac-4d74-b9f7-2da632308ca2/Frame+10.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a8e51032-ccac-4d74-b9f7-2da632308ca2/Frame+10.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a8e51032-ccac-4d74-b9f7-2da632308ca2/Frame+10.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a8e51032-ccac-4d74-b9f7-2da632308ca2/Frame+10.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a8e51032-ccac-4d74-b9f7-2da632308ca2/Frame+10.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a8e51032-ccac-4d74-b9f7-2da632308ca2/Frame+10.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a8e51032-ccac-4d74-b9f7-2da632308ca2/Frame+10.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a8e51032-ccac-4d74-b9f7-2da632308ca2/Frame+10.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>I was so delighted and honored to be on <a href=\"https://codycookparrott.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Cody Cook-Parrott’s</a> podcast, <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/common-shapes/id1687144058\" target=\"_blank\">Common Shapes</a> — where we had a conversation about business ecosystems, website as archives, platform-free business life, growing newsletters and community offerings, and the ongoing work of decompartmentalizing art &amp; business. </p><p>Cody is such an example of a generous, grounded approach to making the multi-faceted creative life sustainable, tangible, and real. it was the first time we spoke (live) and I was so very happy how easy it was to talk to them… about anything! their podcast and soothing voice has been my ongoing companion for long city walks in Istanbul. <br /><br /><br /><strong>explore </strong><a href=\"https://codycookparrott.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cody’s website</strong></a><strong><br />subscribe to their </strong><a href=\"https://buttondown.com/codycookparrott\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>newsletter</strong></a><strong><br />&amp; their new book, </strong><a href=\"https://thepracticeofattention.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>The Practice of Attention</strong></a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> ","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"e800e82b12a52fd18c7dbc2ac52fe3aa282ea051dc6998c8e6668007162f6f22","category":"Sites"}